{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01QrYHx3MeGJ8TWLxK4cJFXN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tULIDGEN(1)                  General Commands Manual                 ULIDGEN(1)\n2\t\n3\tNAME\n4\t     ulidgen – generate or tag lines with ULID\n5\t\n6\tSYNOPSIS\n7\t     ulidgen [-n N] [-t]\n8\t\n9\tDESCRIPTION\n10\t     ulidgen generates and prints one or multiple ULID (Universally Unique\n11\t     Lexicographically Sortable Identifier).\n12\t\n13\t     The options are as follows:\n14\t\n15\t     -n N    Print N consecutive ULID.\n16\t\n17\t     -t      Read lines from standard input, and prefix each line with a ULID.\n18\t\n19\tEXIT STATUS\n20\t     The ulidgen utility exits 0 on success, and >0 if an error occurs.\n21\t\n22\tEXAMPLES\n23\t     Generating three ULID:\n24\t\n25\t           % ulidgen -n 3\n26\t           01J970QT8Y3F9H32BHX76RRS7T\n27\t           01J970QT8Y3F9H32BHX76RRS7V\n28\t           01J970QT8Y3F9H32BHX76RRS7W\n29\t\n30\tSEE ALSO\n31\t     https://github.com/ulid/spec#specification\n32\t\n33\t     uuidgen(1)\n34\t\n35\tAUTHORS\n36\t     Leah Neukirchen <leah@vuxu.org>\n37\t\n38\tLICENSE\n39\t     ulidgen is in the public domain.\n40\t\n41\t     To the extent possible under law, the creator of this work has waived all\n42\t     copyright and related or neighboring rights to this work.\n43\t\n44\t     http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\n45\t\n46\tVoid Linux                      October 2, 2024                     Void Linux\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffde18ee-1808-40b4-b1fa-4e2565b7e12b","uuid":"ade934d6-ee0d-4dfa-9ee6-d6bbf8bdf629","timestamp":"2026-06-03T06:32:59.341Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-31062124/harvest-crust-7TMDlP/project/c_src/README","content":"ULIDGEN(1)                  General Commands Manual                 ULIDGEN(1)\n\nNAME\n     ulidgen – generate or tag lines with ULID\n\nSYNOPSIS\n     ulidgen [-n N] [-t]\n\nDE